    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "json": [
        {
          "text": "This small enchanted orb can be infused with my mana if I use it, similar to the mana gem fragment. Once it has some mana in it, I can equip it and it will levitate near my head. \n\nIt seems to dislike the monsters of this world and will lash out with small arcane bolts. It's not much damage, but it can help keep me from being overwhelmed. \n\n"
        },
        {
          "text": "The orb can be enchanted to enhance its functionality.",
          "color": "dark_purple"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "title",
      "value": "Bane of Arthropods"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "Applies slow to spiders, endermites, and silverfish hit equivalent to the enchantment level."
    },
    {
